HISTORY the ithaperture in order j can be found as                              HISTORY follows:lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                         HISTORY (i-1)],flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                            HISTORY (i-1)],uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                     HISTORY (i-1)],flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].The spectra         HISTORY in the file(s) spectra0031.fits,                                        HISTORY spectra0032.fits,spectra0033.fits, spectra0034.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0035.fits,spectra0036.fits, spectra0037.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0038.fits,spectra0039.fits, spectra0040.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0041.fits,spectra0042.fits, spectra0043.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0044.fits werecombined using a robust weighted mean with         HISTORY a sigma threshold of8.  Aperture 1 modifications: The scale             HISTORY factors were determinedusing order 1 and are:                           HISTORY 0.9181955861568167, 0.9112610040880144,0.9995977918612744,              HISTORY 0.9732392465614422, 0.9988377845441387,0.9753801237313144,              HISTORY 1.017688195754983, 1.032619252797449,1.000402531941972,                 HISTORY 1.0087573082805634, 1.0111060424360405,1.052511819696762,               HISTORY 1.0595972614526061, 0.9898644630366226.                                 END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             